# stackcube.green — ManiSkill Panda StackCube proof specification
objects: [gripper, cubeA(size_cm=4), cubeB(size_cm=4)]
1. grasp:   moves_with(gripper, cubeA) and lifted(cubeA, min_cm=2.0)
2. place:   on(cubeA, cubeB, align_xy_cm<=3.33, gap_cm<=0.5)
3. release: not moves_with(gripper, cubeA) and dwell(cubeA, cubeB, for_s=0.5)
